<title>USA: James River says holders ok Fort merge.</title>
<headline>James River says holders ok Fort merge.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>James River Corp said Tuesday the $5.8 billion merger with Fort Howard Corp was approved by shareholders of both companies.</p>
<p>They also approved changing the name of the company to Fort James Corp, increasing the authorized number of common shares to 500 million, expanding the board to fifteen members, and reserving additional common shares issuable under the stock incentive plan.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the merger to be finalized August 13.</p>
</text>
